LICENSE NOT YET SELECTED
========================

This artifact repository MUST NOT be made public until this file is replaced with the actual
license text. A public repository without a license grants no rights to anyone, which would defeat
the purpose of releasing a reproducibility artifact.

Pending decision by the authors.

Suggested arrangement for a research artifact of this kind, for the authors to confirm or replace:

  - Source code (scripts/, analysis/, prompts/):  MIT or Apache-2.0
  - Data and documentation (data/, results/, rules/, logs/, docs/):  CC BY 4.0

If two licenses are used, state clearly in README.md which directories each one covers.

Note that third-party datasets referenced by this repository carry their own terms and are not
relicensed by this file. Those are not redistributed here; see data/ for retrieval instructions and
provenance.

Once chosen, record the SPDX identifier in CITATION.cff as well.
